"<strong>Q4.</strong> In <strong>Real transformer, no load</strong>, nothing is connected to the secondary, yet the primary draws about {#} mA from the {#} V source. Why does it draw a current, why does that current lag the voltage by almost {#}°, and how much power does it take?",
"<strong>Q5.</strong> A station sends {#} MW down a line whose two wires have {#} Ω in all. Find the share of the power lost at {#} kV and at {#} kV.",
